        "net_locator": "1-3-26",
        "spans_beyond_this_verse": false,
        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "Rama's giving his ring to Hanuma as a token for Seetha's recognition... and the monkeys thus searching Riksha cave, bear-cave, and their fasting unto death for their quest remained unsuccessful, and their seeing Sampaati, another mighty eagle and the brother of slain Jatayu, who guides the monkeys to the destination where Seetha is held captive. [1-3-26]"
      }
    ],
